    "body": "<p>Learn how to display a customer review on a Klaviyo sign-up form to build trust with your site visitors and encourage more submissions.</p>\n<p>You can choose between adding a store review or specific product review to showcase on your sign-up form and customize the styling to match your brand.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JTGPWF8939CGHP3GSZV87MBQ\">Before you begin</h2>\n<p>If this is your first time creating a sign-up form, learn the basics of <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360026474752\">getting started with sign-up forms</a>.</p>\n<p>If you haven’t yet, make sure to set up <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/15937542819355\">Klaviyo Reviews</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JTGPWF89MHD03QVDZ940CXJ8\">Add the review block to your form</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>From Klaviyo's main navigation, select <strong>Sign-up forms</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Create form</strong>. From here you can either:<br>\n<ul>\n<ul>\n<li> Customize a pre-built template from the form library</li>\n<li> Click <strong>Create blank form</strong> in the top right corner to start from scratch.</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>In the form editor, click <strong>Add blocks</strong> from the <em>Overview </em>sidebar.</li>\n<li>Select the <strong>Review quote</strong> block and drag the block onto your form.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/36635960432155\" alt=\"\">\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Add review</strong>.</li>\n<li>Select either <strong>Store reviews </strong>or <strong>Product reviews</strong>.</li>\n<li>Browse the list of available reviews and click <strong>Select</strong> next to the one you want to display.<br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/36635960444187\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>You can show multiple reviews by adding more review blocks to your form. However, we recommend displaying no more than 2–3 reviews to keep your form clean and focused.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JTGPWF898RSWV97AG5GPN22F\">Review filter options</h2>\n<p>When choosing a review to display, there are several options for filtering through reviews, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><strong>Search</strong></strong><br>\nSearch for reviews containing a specific word or phrase.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Rating</strong><br>\nFilter by number of stars.</li>\n<li>\n<strong><strong>Verified</strong></strong><br>\nShow only verified customers.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Exclude incentivized</strong><br>\nOmit reviews given in exchange for incentives.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Time period</strong><br>\nLimit display to reviews submitted within a specified timeframe.</li>\n<li>\n<strong><strong>Length</strong></strong><br>\nLimit display to reviews with a specified length.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/36635960446363\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JTGPWF893GRK0TMXRBHCKYWX\">Edit review block appearance</h2>\n<p>After adding a review block and selecting a review quote to display, you can toggle the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><strong>Rating</strong></strong><br>\nWhether or not to show the star rating.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Reviewer name</strong><br>\nWhether or not to show the reviewer’s first name and first letter of their last name, e.g. James S.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Verified badge</strong><br>\nWhether or not to show the verified checkmark next to the reviewer’s name if it is a verified review.<br>\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/36635973728539\" alt=\"\" width=\"341\" height=\"197\">\n<p>You can also adjust the styling for the following sections to make sure the font and colors align with your brand:</p>\n</li>\n<li>Rating</li>\n<li>Quote text</li>\n<li>Reviewer name text</li>\n<li>Verified badge style</li>\n<li>Block padding</li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
